      "id": "rdls_exp-kmap_inforac_populationwithoutaccesssa",
      "title": "Population without access to safely managed drinking water service (MSSD indicator 14)",
      "description": "In 2017, the proportion of population using safely managed drinking water services was over 90% in 16 countries in the Mediterranean region. However, estimates are available only these 16 countries and there is no data for most of the Southern countries. In countries where data is available, the population without access to safely managed drinking water services decreased from 37 million in 2000 to 21.9 million in 2017. Similar to SDG Indicator 6.1.1 Source: https://www.obs.planbleu.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/SMDD_Dashboard_Version_Mars_2021.pdf [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal kmap_inforac]",
